# Exploration (M6): CONTINUE from build/m6-saves/celine-shadows-depths-1; capture arrival, status pages,
# inventory and the quest list. Same title/CONTINUE sequence as tests/save/save_continue.kufscript.
500 tap Return
700 press Return
850 press Return
1000 press Down
1050 capture main_menu
1100 press Return
1250 capture continue_list
1300 repeat 60 until gameplay press Return
@gameplay+30 capture arrive_1
@gameplay+90 capture arrive_2
@gameplay+150 capture arrive_3
@gameplay+300 capture arrive_4
@gameplay+400 tap Tab
@gameplay+480 capture status
@gameplay+500 tap C
@gameplay+580 capture page2
@gameplay+600 tap C
@gameplay+680 capture page3
@gameplay+700 tap C
@gameplay+780 capture page4
@gameplay+800 tap PageDown
@gameplay+880 capture inventory
@gameplay+900 tap Escape
@gameplay+980 tap Escape
@gameplay+1080 tap Escape
@gameplay+1160 capture pause_menu
@gameplay+1200 press Down
@gameplay+1260 press Down
@gameplay+1320 capture pause_quests_selected
@gameplay+1360 press Return
@gameplay+1460 capture quests
@gameplay+1560 press Down
@gameplay+1620 capture quests_2
